{"format":1,"id":"atem_beobachten","kurz":"ab","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Atem beobachten","untertitel":"Den Atem kommen und gehen lassen. Wenn die Gedanken wandern, freundlich zurückkehren.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":600},"lang":{"ziel_s":1200}},"kb":1088,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/1.ca634f7f.mp3","ms":4623,"text":"Setz dich bequem und aufrecht hin, oder leg dich auf den Rücken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/2.23ddbc48.mp3","ms":7152,"text":"Wenn du magst, schließ die Augen. Du kannst sie auch offen lassen und den Blick senken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/3.19dd2483.mp3","ms":4423,"text":"Du kannst jederzeit aufhören, wenn dir etwas nicht guttut.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/4.442469d9.mp3","ms":7716,"text":"Spür, wie dein Körper getragen wird. Vom Stuhl, vom Boden, von der Unterlage.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/5.a54c5081.mp3","ms":2532,"text":"Lass die Schultern ein wenig sinken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/6.4b397a8d.mp3","ms":2528,"text":"Und lass das Gesicht weich werden.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"atem","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/7.03514aac.mp3","ms":3719,"text":"Richte deine Aufmerksamkeit jetzt auf deinen Atem.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/8.284c9035.mp3","ms":5516,"text":"Du musst nichts verändern. Der Atem kommt und geht von allein.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/9.6ce8082a.mp3","ms":7510,"text":"Such dir eine Stelle, an der du ihn gut spürst. An der Nase, in der Brust oder am Bauch.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/10.9e3156ee.mp3","ms":4646,"text":"Spür das Einatmen. Und das Ausatmen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/11.b383b898.mp3","ms":6377,"text":"Wenn sich der Atem unangenehm anfühlt, kannst du stattdessen auf die Geräusche um dich herum hören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/12.b30af41d.mp3","ms":5897,"text":"Oder deine Füße am Boden spüren. Dorthin kehrst du dann immer zurück.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/13.b2a7640b.mp3","ms":4173,"text":"Vielleicht merkst du, wie sich die Bauchdecke hebt und senkt.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/14.f2e56a3a.mp3","ms":5659,"text":"Oder wie die Luft an der Nase etwas kühler hereinkommt und etwas wärmer hinausgeht.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37.4,"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}}]},{"id":"abschweifen","segmente":[{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/15.47092214.mp3","ms":5842,"text":"Früher oder später wandern deine Gedanken. Das ist ganz normal.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/16.c78aa42a.mp3","ms":4002,"text":"Sobald du es bemerkst, sag innerlich: denken.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/17.e9ebdc12.mp3","ms":2815,"text":"Und kehr freundlich zum Atem zurück.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/18.f1061611.mp3","ms":5994,"text":"Du machst dabei nichts falsch. Das Zurückkehren ist die eigentliche Übung.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37.4,"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/19.01cb7592.mp3","ms":4660,"text":"Spür den nächsten Atemzug. Nur diesen einen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37.4,"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/20.0a6f6ba4.mp3","ms":6981,"text":"Wo sind deine Gedanken gerade? Wenn sie gewandert sind, komm einfach wieder zurück.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/21.30265fc4.mp3","ms":2109,"text":"Zu diesem einen Atemzug.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/22.68464013.mp3","ms":5818,"text":"Vielleicht ist da Unruhe oder Langeweile. Auch das darf da sein.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/23.9ba3dd9b.mp3","ms":3104,"text":"Bemerk es, und geh wieder zum Atem.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/24.89b410aa.mp3","ms":2903,"text":"Jeder Atemzug ist ein neuer Anfang.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/25.7bd30725.mp3","ms":6293,"text":"Spür, wo das Einatmen beginnt. Und wo das Ausatmen endet.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/26.15110140.mp3","ms":5263,"text":"Vielleicht gibt es eine kleine Pause, bevor der nächste Atemzug kommt.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s027","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/27.343ba5f6.mp3","ms":6513,"text":"Wenn du müde wirst, richte dich etwas auf. Oder öffne kurz die Augen.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s028","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/28.a70006de.mp3","ms":6982,"text":"Wenn ein Gefühl stark wird, darfst du es bemerken. Und dann wieder zum Atem gehen.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s029","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/29.ae4396e2.mp3","ms":5492,"text":"Du musst nichts erreichen. Nur bemerken, und zurückkehren.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.3}}]},{"id":"weiten","segmente":[{"id":"s030","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/30.7712d9ab.mp3","ms":3149,"text":"Lass die Aufmerksamkeit jetzt weiter werden.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s031","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/31.2ac155b2.mp3","ms":4443,"text":"Spür den ganzen Körper, wie er sitzt oder liegt und atmet.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s032","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/32.51374fee.mp3","ms":4386,"text":"Geräusche, Gedanken und Empfindungen dürfen kommen und gehen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st10","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37.4,"normal":55.3,"lang":69.3}},{"id":"s033","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/33.9582a8f3.mp3","ms":3237,"text":"Bleib noch eine Weile so, offen und wach.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st11","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.3}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s034","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/34.2dcc3a19.mp3","ms":2780,"text":"Langsam kommst du zum Ende der Übung.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s035","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/35.cfb720da.mp3","ms":4279,"text":"Atme einmal etwas tiefer ein. Und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s036","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/36.c40bf1a8.mp3","ms":2383,"text":"Beweg die Finger und die Zehen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s037","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/37.aea99195.mp3","ms":2957,"text":"Wenn du so weit bist, öffne die Augen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s038","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/38.90dd48de.mp3","ms":4958,"text":"Vielleicht nimmst du ein wenig von dieser Ruhe mit in das, was jetzt kommt.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s039","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/39.8ea7f406.mp3","ms":3532,"text":"Wenn du gelegen hast, steh langsam auf.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}